BEGIN_PGML Compute [`(-8)^2\text{.}`]
[_]{64}{10}
END_PGML
########## # Solution ##########
BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION Since [`8^2`] is [`64`] and we are raising a negative number to an _even_ power, the answer is positive: [`64\text{.}`]
END_PGML_SOLUTION
