BEGIN_PGML Calculate the power [`(-1)^{203}\text{.}`]
[_]{-1}{10}
END_PGML
########## # Solution ##########
BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION Since [`1^{203}`] is [`1`] and we are raising a negative number to an _odd_ power, the answer is negative: [`-1\text{.}`]
END_PGML_SOLUTION
