BEGIN_PGML Find [`(-3)^3\text{.}`]
[_]{-27}{10}
END_PGML
########## # Solution ##########
BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION Since [`3^{3}`] is [`27`] and we are raising a negative number to an _odd_ power, the answer is negative: [`-27\text{.}`]
END_PGML_SOLUTION
